infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Pre-2024 forced choice (before PgBouncer 1.21)
  desc Transaction mode OR prepared statements — never both
  compares
    - label Transaction mode
      children
        - label Multiplexing 10-100x
          desc Many clients share few backends
        - label Cost paid
          desc Disable prepared statements at driver
        - label Lose 10-30% throughput
          desc On repeated queries, cached plans gone
    - label Prepared statements
      children
        - label Throughput +10-30%
          desc Cached query plans on repeated queries
        - label Cost paid
          desc Pin to a backend, so session mode
        - label Lose multiplexing
          desc No 10-100x backend sharing
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f43f5e
